BREATH="HEAVY SLOW BREATHING of a big armoured guardian: frames 1-4 he breathes in deeply, his chest swells and his shoulders and heavy shoulder armour lift a little, frame 5 holds the full breath, frames 6-8 he breathes out, chest and shoulders sink and settle back down; the arms ride up and down with the shoulders so the hammer and shield rise and sink by a few pixels, the leaves on his antlers rustle softly and the cape hem sways a little. Feet stay planted flat on the same ground line, legs do not move, the head only rides gently with the shoulders, calm face with open eyes. Heavy and grounded, never floaty or bouncy."
